{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/bee7251eeb7be9e6302a59f6129a22ca.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1200 height=161 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There\u2019s <strong>four game modes and 20 maps</strong>, each tightly designed for the unique Mewt mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Slingball, Brawl, Obstacle Race</strong> and <strong>King of the Hill!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/f0c3ec25584e6b3cdbd07f85e9ec5747.poster.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/f0c3ec25584e6b3cdbd07f85e9ec5747.webm?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/f0c3ec25584e6b3cdbd07f85e9ec5747.mp4?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/83b876d31bfeca81cf7c3611bcdad248.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1200 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Slingshot bombs in each other\u2019s clay faces in <strong>1-4 players locally or online!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/d1aabadf3f67cae383664a862a2b0ca5.poster.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/d1aabadf3f67cae383664a862a2b0ca5.webm?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/d1aabadf3f67cae383664a862a2b0ca5.mp4?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/387f45782fdaf68420c9fc80c2486009.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1200 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as clay worms that can dash around, <strong>grab their ends</strong>, <strong>stretch</strong>, and <strong>use their bodies as slingshots! </strong>(And wobble - it makes them cuter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/67c6fd276dc4c11ee71b6613444accc0.poster.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/67c6fd276dc4c11ee71b6613444accc0.webm?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/67c6fd276dc4c11ee71b6613444accc0.mp4?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/20aa759916a00dd9240b557bd7498fa5.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1200 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Everything looks like it was built in a playroom from clay</strong> (because it was)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/e31e22f816f4bf367e184ddfd0ee4a81.poster.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/e31e22f816f4bf367e184ddfd0ee4a81.webm?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/e31e22f816f4bf367e184ddfd0ee4a81.mp4?t=1771338023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939660/extras/b8236dd96d0e68debab262c07ccb0a9e.avif?t=1771338023\" width=1200 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Slingball</strong> you try to get a ball in a goal using your stretching, slingshotting and visceral assault of other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Brawl</strong> it\u2019s just the assault of other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>King of the Hill</strong> you risk everything to be the one to get the points in the middle but everyone gets to bully you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Obstacle Race</strong> you uh, well, assault other players and also race. The slowest one is eliminated!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939660?t=1771338023","backg